## 2. 💾 Local Storage Architecture

Since there's no backend, **localStorage** (and optionally **IndexedDB**) will be your persistence layer.

### Storage Schema Design

```json
{
  "user_profile": {
    "name": "Rahul Sharma",
    "jobTitle": "Frontend Developer",
    "experience": "1-2 years",
    "skills": ["React", "JavaScript", "CSS"],
    "location": ["Bangalore", "Remote"],
    "workMode": "Remote",
    "jobType": "Full-time",
    "salary": "4-8 LPA",
    "noticePeriod": "30 days",
    "education": "B.Tech",
    "resumeText": "...(extracted text from PDF)...",
    "lastUpdated": "2026-09-03T11:57:56+05:30"
  },
  "job_results": {
    "lastFetchedAt": "2026-09-03T11:57:56+05:30",
    "results": [
      {
        "id": "uuid",
        "title": "Frontend Developer",
        "company": "TechCorp",
        "location": "Bangalore",
        "platform": "LinkedIn",
        "url": "https://...",
        "salary": "5-8 LPA",
