## 3. 🔍 Job Platforms — Automation Analysis

### Platform 1: **Naukri.com** ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ (Best for India)

| Aspect | Details |
|---|---|
| **Target Audience** | Indian market — freshers to experienced |
| **Search URL Pattern** | `https://www.naukri.com/jobs-in-bangalore?k=frontend+developer&experience=1` |
| **Query Parameters** | `k` (keywords), `l` (location), `experience`, `salary`, `industry` |
| **API Available?** | ❌ No public API |
| **Automation Approach** | URL-based deep-linking + iframe embedding or redirect |
| **CORS Issues** | ✅ Can construct pre-filled search URLs |
| **Data Scraping** | ❌ Blocked by bot detection (Cloudflare) |
| **Best Approach** | Generate a direct Naukri search URL with params and open in new tab |

**Naukri Deep-Link Format:**
```
https://www.naukri.com/{title}-jobs-in-{location}?k={skills}&experience={years}&salary={range}
```

